# player, facing n. Split from the delivered frames by sprite:split; the parts are now the source.
# The staff, for this facing.
# One-handed focus. North windup holds the long shaft low beside the far
# shoulder; strike sweeps it up outside the hood instead of through the head.
# The crystal roots the code-drawn swift sword.

